      "extract": "The Wilsonian renormalization group (RG) provides the most physical framework to study general properties of quantum ﬁeld theories. In this formulation [1, 2] quantum ﬂuctuations at short distances are integrated out to give an eﬀective action for longer distances. In this approach the bare action can be though as the result of integrating out the degrees of freedom with frequencies higher than the ultraviolet (UV)",
      "extractCut": true
    },
