      "extract": "In the RG formulation the ST identity for the physical eﬀective action Γ[Φ, γ] ≡Γ[Φ, γ; 0, ∞] is ensured if the cutoﬀeﬀective action satisﬁes a modiﬁed ST [3]-[7]. As usual in studying 1For a generalization of this proof to gauge theories see for instance [4]. 3 ST identities, it is convenient to remove from the functional Π given in (4) the gauge ﬁxing term and introduce the Slavnov operator [13] SΠ′ = −i Z p \u0012 δ",
